graph TD
    subgraph Right-Angled Triangle
        A[Perpendicular Side 1 (Axis)]
        B[Perpendicular Side 2]
        C[Hypotenuse]
    end

    A -- Revolves around itself --> H(Cone Height)
    B -- Sweeps out --> R(Cone Radius)
    C -- Forms --> S(Cone Slant Height)

    H & R & S -- Combine to Form --> CONE[Cone]